            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "ど、どうしよう……何の気なしに\r\nノート貸しちゃったけど……。",
            "enText": "O-Oh no… I lent out my notebook \nwithout thinking about it…",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 4996430508938658745,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "あのノート、落書きしてた気が……\r\nなに描いてたっけ……。",
            "enText": "But I've just realized, I think I drew \nsomething in it… What was it again?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 9079858069179742302,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "猫……？　犬……？　『ウマ☆恋』の\r\n桜花ちゃんを描いたような気も……。",
            "enText": "A cat? …A dog? It might've been Oka from \nthe manga <i>Uma ☆ Koi</i>…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 3293897474750047249,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "うぅ……どうか見つかりませんように……！",
            "enText": "Ooh… I hope they don't find it!",
